<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the Family and Human Development PhD program at the T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics! Please review the <a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/sites/default/files/handbook_fhd_grad_march_2016.pdf">program handbook</a> for information on the admission process, courses offered, plan of study, dissertation details and more.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Applications for the next academic year are accepted from September 1 to January 15. Application reviews begin in early January. Please visit the <a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/node/17">program's website</a> for any updates.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Once you have reviewed the handbook, please email <a href="mailto:graduatesanford@asu.edu">me</a> with any questions you may have.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/how-and-when-apply-graduate-admission">Start your application today</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you and we look forward to hearing from you!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Gina Perez, M.Ed.&nbsp;</b></div><div><font face="arial">Graduate Programs Coordinator</font></div><div><font face="arial">T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics</font></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>